{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Magic is a small RPG about finally doing that one thing you've wanted to do for a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been living in a treehouse in your small home town for as long as you can remember. But today's the day you finally wake up and walk out the gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven RPG elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time shoot-em-up combat VS wizards and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 hours playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-violent battle resolutions (sorta!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Arkington Owen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support and accessibility options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden bonus minigames...?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896170?t=1759287991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896170?t=1759287991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/4a9d98aa5dfbccfc27a0f304ca5f14ca1584464c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759287991","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/4a9d98aa5dfbccfc27a0f304ca5f14ca1584464c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759287991","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Magic is a small RPG about finally doing that one thing you've wanted to do for a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been living in a treehouse in your s